      "message": "Both are possible, and it\u0027s a fundamental problem with xfrm_state_lookup() (called by xfrm_state_locate()). Because the mark match is done on an existing SA, you can always end up in a situation where the mark finds the \"zero\" SA. I\u0027ve uploaded a test that demonstrates why someone doing what you suggest is already borked.\n\nhttps://android-review.googlesource.com/#/c/kernel/tests/+/680958",
